# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions (UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>).
# Format: `<check>:<file or function substring>`, e.g. `vptr:libQt6Core`,
# `function:libprotobuf`, `alignment:sqlite3`.
#
# Rules: dependency noise only, one justification line per entry, never suppress a
# finding in Modules/ or App/ - fix it.
#
# Known repeat offenders in Qt/protobuf-heavy trees (NOT enabled; enable only
# with a matching report):
#   Qt moc-generated meta-call casts on type-erased QObject pointers under -fsanitize=vptr:
#   vptr:libQt6Core
#   Indirect calls through Qt's function-pointer tables built by a different toolchain
#   (-fsanitize=function, Clang only):
#   function:libQt6Qml
#
# Empty until a real run proves otherwise.
